# Release signing keys for agent-mesh.
#
# Every agent verifies release tags against this list before installing an
# update. `agent-mesh trust` copies it to ~/.agent-mesh/trusted_signers on
# first use and treats any later change as an event, not as routine.
#
# Format: <principal> <key-type> <base64-key>
# Example:
#   release@moinsen.dev ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAA...
#
# NOT YET CONFIGURED — see docs/RELEASING.md. Until a real key is listed here,
# agents refuse to install updates. That is deliberate: an empty trust base
# must block, never wave things through.
